| TeX Live 2026 for RISC OS: !Boot
|
| The Filer runs this when it first sees !TeXLive. It makes this copy's
| commands (pdflatex, pdftex, kpsewhich) available at the command line,
| unless another copy has already done so. Double-clicking a copy makes that
| copy the one used.
If "<TeXLive$Dir>" = "" Then Set TeXLive$Dir <Obey$Dir>
If "<TeXLive$Dir>" = "<Obey$Dir>" Then Obey <Obey$Dir>.Resources.Commands
